            </note>
            <note corresp="#d36-f2" n="1" xml:id="d36-f2-content">
                <p>The meeting took place from 2:40 to 3:30 p.m. and was attended by the President,
                    Vice President Johnson, McNamara, Burke, Nitze, Bowles, Parsons, Bohlen, Dulles,
                    Bissell, Clifton, FitzGerald, McGeorge Bundy, Rostow, and Sorensen. It was
                    characterized as “off the record.” (Kennedy Library, President’s Appointment
                    Book, Book I)</p>
            </note>
